"Cafeteria North is Celena North University's largest dining hall, not open to the public."
"It is themed as a European city square, with cobblestones, a clear ceiling and a marble fountain."
"It has a 24/7 snack shop and drones food across campus."
"Hero-track applicants may drone in food from it for free on test day."
"Applicants wait there for their admission results; one jumped in the fountain on acceptance."
